{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765030,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Startup Conclave 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":11906,"web_url":"www.akgec.ac.in\/conclave2026\/","start_date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-10T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/startup-conclave-2026-ajay-kumar-garg-engineering-college-akgec-ghaziabad-1765030","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About Startup Conclave 2026<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Startup Conclave 2026 is a two-day entrepreneurship event hosted by Idea Lab at Ajay Kumar Garg Engineering College (AKGEC), Ghaziabad, on 15&ndash;16 October 2026. Its theme is <strong>\"Bridging the Gap Between Vision and Venture\"<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>The conclave brings together students, aspiring entrepreneurs, founders, mentors, industry experts and innovators. It gives young innovators a platform to present their ideas, gain exposure and connect with the wider startup ecosystem.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Expert Sessions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Gain practical insights into entrepreneurship, startup development, funding, intellectual property and the evolving startup ecosystem through sessions led by industry experts.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Founder Interactions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Hear directly from founders about their entrepreneurial journeys, experiences, challenges and the process of taking an idea from concept to market.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Startup Exhibition<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Explore innovative startups, interact with founders and discover emerging ideas, products and solutions.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Investor Interaction<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Engage with investors and industry representatives to understand the funding landscape and explore opportunities within the startup ecosystem.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Mentorship<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Receive valuable guidance and feedback to refine your ideas, strengthen your business approach and understand the path towards commercialization.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Startup Pitching Competition<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Present your startup or innovative idea before a jury and demonstrate its potential, vision and approach.<\/p>\n<p>The two-day programme includes expert sessions, workshops, founder talks, a startup exhibition, investor interactions, mentorship and the Startup Pitching Competition.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pitch your startup idea, concept or working prototype to industry experts<\/li>\n<li>Showcase your work at the startup exhibition<\/li>\n<li>Compete for cash prizes for the best pitching ideas with prototypes<\/li>\n<li>Explore pre-incubation support of up to \u20b93 lakh<\/li>\n<li>Learn from founders, investors and mentors, and build your network<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Who Can Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Students with a startup idea, an innovative concept or a working prototype can register under <strong>Startup\/Pitch Registration<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Students who want to attend, explore the ecosystem and meet innovators can register under <strong>Attendee Registration<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Eligibility:<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Startup Conclave 2026 welcomes:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Students<\/li>\n<li>Startups<\/li>\n<li>Innovators<\/li>\n<li>Aspiring Entrepreneurs<\/li>\n<li>Founders<\/li>\n<li>Individuals interested in entrepreneurship and innovation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Categories<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Startup\/Pitch Registration:<\/strong> for students who wish to pitch and showcase their startup idea, concept or working prototype.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Attendee Registration:<\/strong> for students who wish to attend, connect and engage with the startup ecosystem.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Startup Pitching Competition<\/strong><br \/>Present your idea before a jury and demonstrate its potential.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Expert Sessions<\/strong><br \/>Learn from professionals working across entrepreneurship and the startup ecosystem.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Founder Interactions<\/strong><br \/>Gain insights from real entrepreneurial journeys and experiences.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Startup Exhibition<\/strong><br \/>Discover and engage with innovative startups and ideas.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Investor Interaction<\/strong><br \/>Connect with investors and understand the startup funding ecosystem.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Mentorship<\/strong><br \/>Receive feedback and guidance to help refine your venture.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Awards and Recognition<\/strong><br \/>Get recognized for promising ideas and entrepreneurial potential.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Seed Funding Opportunity<\/strong><br \/>An opportunity of up to <strong>\u20b93 lakh<\/strong> for the most promising startups.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Competition Structure<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1: Registration and Application.<\/strong> Submit your idea details through the registration form. The organising team reviews all Startup\/Pitch applications.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Shortlisting.<\/strong> Shortlisted participants are contacted separately by the organising team about the final round.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Final Round: Pitching Competition.<\/strong> Shortlisted teams pitch live before industry experts at AKGEC, Ghaziabad<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates and Deadlines<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Registration deadline:<\/strong> <strong>10<sup>th<\/sup>&nbsp; October 2026, 11:59 P.M&nbsp; IST<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Shortlist announcement:<\/strong> <strong>13<sup>th<\/sup> October 2026<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Event:<\/strong> 15&ndash;16 October 2026 (Day 1 starts at 9:00 AM; Day 2 starts at 10:00 AM)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Final pitching round:<\/strong> <strong>16 October 2026.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Venue<\/strong><br \/>Ajay Kumar Garg Engineering College, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh (offline event)<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rewards and Prizes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pre-incubation support of up to \u20b93 lakh.<\/li>\n<li>Participation certificate.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Security Advisory<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>All official updates will come only from <strong>idealab@akgec.ac.in<\/strong> or the contact numbers below.<\/li>\n<li>The organising team will never ask for banking details, OTPs, sensitive credentials or any payment for shortlisting or selection.<\/li>\n<li>Do not make payments to external links, personal UPI IDs or third-party contacts claiming to represent the conclave.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Take Your Idea from Vision to Venture<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>An idea becomes meaningful when it is developed, tested and given the right opportunity to grow. <strong>Startup Conclave 2026<\/strong> brings together the people, knowledge and opportunities that can help bridge that journey.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Pitch your idea. Connect with the ecosystem. Build what comes next.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>15&ndash;16 October 2026 | AKGEC Campus, Ghaziabad<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Contact the Organisers:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>+91 7982756664<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>+91 95487 08361<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33455857,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-02T22:20:15+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T09:26:46+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"innovation_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"DbhIUgx","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":3,"referral_lead